      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I had the same issue and it was driving me nuts, so I made a test world and ran into tons of other issues with teleport. Teleport in general seems to be extremely unreliable and fails a lot of times or produces unwanted results randomly (including that the view is not where the avatar is). I am now doing teleport in Update for at least 4 frames and also at the start of Update() to be absolutely sure it works. So my OnDezerialization only flips a bool. On top of that, teleport looks ugly since it affects dynamic bones. This should not be the case.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
