      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5b7fb61894211b58b866e8ae|full_name}: If you have a lot of colliders in between, are teleporting into a small room (elevator) with collider walls and are also moving the room you want to teleport into and also teleport over a few hundred meters, teleporting is guaranteed to fail in Update every 6. time or so. And it fails in all different ways. Once I even ended up having  UI \"burned\" into my FOV.",
